---

## Known limitations

- Duplicate detection is content-based (hash), not name-based — files with
  different names but identical content are still flagged as duplicates
- Only one "undo generation" is kept at a time — running the pipeline again
  before undoing will overwrite the previous undo log
- Very large folders (tens of thousands of files) may be slow since hashing
  reads full file contents
- No built-in scheduling — the tool runs on demand only

